---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Prices
description: Haircut prices at Brad's Barber Shop in Spanish Fork, Utah. Walk-ins welcome, or call to book a time.
---
<section class="page-head"><div class="wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Prices</p>
  <h1>Haircuts and prices</h1>
  <p class="lead">Simple menu, classic cuts. Every haircut is finished with a straight-razor neck shave.</p>
</div></section>

<section class="section-tight"><div class="wrap grid-2">
  <div class="card board">
    <h2>Haircuts</h2>
    {%- set services = shop.services -%}{%- set showDescriptions = true -%}
    {% include "partials/price-list.njk" %}
    <p class="small">Prices as posted in the shop.</p>
    <div class="board-art">{% include "art/shears-comb.svg" %}</div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol class="steps">
      <li><b>Walk in</b> any time we're open and take a seat.</li>
      <li><b>Or call ahead</b> at <a href="tel:{{ shop.phone.tel }}">{{ shop.phone.display }}</a> to book a time.</li>
      <li><b>Leave sharp.</b> Every cut ends with a straight-razor neck shave.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2 style="margin-top:28px">Hours</h2>
    {% include "partials/hours-table.njk" %}
  </div>
</div></section>

<div class="strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band" aria-label="Call to book"><div class="wrap" style="text-align:center">
  <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.7rem,3.4vw,2.3rem);margin-bottom:18px">Ready for a cut?</h2>
  <div class="cta" style="justify-content:center">
    <a class="btn btn-solid" href="tel:{{ shop.phone.tel }}">Call {{ shop.phone.display }}</a>
    <a class="btn btn-line" style="color:var(--band-ink)" href="{{ shop.maps.directions }}">Get directions</a>
  </div>
</div></section>
